#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:2
msgid "Connect Microsoft Calendar to Mattermost"
msgstr "Microsoft Calendar를 OKR.BEST에 연결"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:7
msgid ""
"Connect your Microsoft M365 Calendar to your Mattermost instance to "
"receive daily summaries of calendar events, synchronize your  M365 status"
" in Mattermost, and accept or decline calendar invites from Mattermost."
msgstr "Microsoft M365 Calendar를 OKR.BEST 인스턴스에 연결하여 캘린더 일정의 일일 요약을 받고, OKR.BEST에서 M365 상태를 동기화하고, OKR.BEST에서 캘린더 초대를 수락하거나 거절할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:10
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "배포"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:12
msgid "Setup starts in Microsoft Azure and ends in Mattermost."
msgstr "설정은 Microsoft Azure에서 시작하여 OKR.BEST에서 끝납니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:15
msgid "Create a Mattermost App in Azure"
msgstr "Azure에서 Mattermost 앱 만들기"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:17
msgid ""
"Sign in to `portal.azure.com <https://portal.azure.com>`_ using an admin "
"Azure account."
msgstr "관리자 Azure 계정으로 `portal.azure.com <https://portal.azure.com>`_\\ 에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to `App Registrations "
"<https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_AAD_IAM/ActiveDirectoryMenuBlade/RegisteredApps>`_"
msgstr "`App Registrations <https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_AAD_IAM/ActiveDirectoryMenuBlade/RegisteredApps>`_\\ 로 이동합니다"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:19
msgid "Select **New registration** at the top of the page."
msgstr "페이지 상단에서 **New registration**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:21
#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:30
msgid "In Azure, create a new app registration."
msgstr "Azure에서 새 앱 등록을 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:24
msgid ""
"Fill out the form with the following values. Select **Register** to "
"submit the form."
msgstr "다음 값으로 양식을 작성합니다. 양식을 제출하려면 **Register**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:26
msgid "**Name**: Mattermost MS Calendar Plugin"
msgstr "**Name**: Mattermost MS Calendar Plugin"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:27
msgid "**Supported account types**: Default value (Single tenant)"
msgstr "**Supported account types**: 기본값(Single tenant)"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Redirect URI**: "
"``https://<MM_SITE_URL>/plugins/com.mattermost.mscalendar/oauth2/complete``"
" Replace ``<MM_SITE_URL>`` with your Mattermost server's Site URL. Select"
" **Register** to submit the form."
msgstr "**Redirect URI**: ``https://<MM_SITE_URL>/plugins/com.mattermost.mscalendar/oauth2/complete`` ``<MM_SITE_URL>``\\ 을 OKR.BEST 서버의 사이트 URL로 바꿉니다. 양식을 제출하려면 **Register**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:33
msgid "Go to **Certificates & secrets** in the left pane."
msgstr "왼쪽 창에서 **Certificates & secrets**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:35
msgid "In Azure, go to Certificates & secrets located in the left pane."
msgstr "Azure에서 왼쪽 창에 있는 Certificates & secrets로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:38
msgid ""
"Select **New client secret > Add**, and copy the new secret in the bottom"
" right corner of the screen. We'll use this value later in the Mattermost"
" System Console."
msgstr "**New client secret > Add**\\ 를 선택하고, 화면 오른쪽 하단에 표시된 새 시크릿을 복사합니다. 이 값은 나중에 OKR.BEST 관리자 도구에서 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:40
msgid "In Azure, create a new client secret and copy the value for later."
msgstr "Azure에서 새 클라이언트 시크릿을 생성하고 나중에 사용할 값을 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:43
msgid "Go to **API permissions** in the left pane."
msgstr "왼쪽 창에서 **API permissions**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:45
msgid "In Azure, go to API permissions located in the left pane."
msgstr "Azure에서 왼쪽 창에 있는 API permissions로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:48
msgid "Select **Add a permission**, then **Microsoft Graph** in the right pane."
msgstr "**Add a permission**\\ 을 선택한 다음, 오른쪽 창에서 **Microsoft Graph**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:50
msgid "In Azure, add a permission for Microsoft Graph."
msgstr "Azure에서 Microsoft Graph에 대한 권한을 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:53
msgid ""
"Select **Delegated permissions**, and scroll down to select the following"
" permissions. Select **Add permissions** to submit the form:"
msgstr "**Delegated permissions**\\ 를 선택하고, 아래로 스크롤하여 다음 권한을 선택합니다. 양식을 제출하려면 **Add permissions**\\ 를 선택합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:55
msgid "``Calendars.ReadWrite``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:56
msgid "``Calendars.ReadWrite.Shared``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:57
#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:67
msgid "``MailboxSettings.Read``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:59
msgid "In Azure, select required permissions."
msgstr "Azure에서 필요한 권한을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:62
msgid ""
"Add application permissions by going to **Add a permission > Microsoft "
"Graph > Application permissions**, and select **Add permissions** to "
"submit the form."
msgstr "**Add a permission > Microsoft Graph > Application permissions**\\ 로 이동하여 애플리케이션 권한을 추가하고, 양식을 제출하려면 **Add permissions**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:64
msgid ""
"Select the following permissions, and then select **Grant admin consent "
"for mattermost** to grant the permissions for the application."
msgstr "다음 권한을 선택한 다음, 애플리케이션에 권한을 부여하려면 **Grant admin consent for mattermost**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:66
msgid "``Calendars.Read``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:68
msgid "``User.Read.All``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:70
msgid "In Azure, grant admin consent permissions for the application."
msgstr "Azure에서 애플리케이션에 대한 관리자 동의 권한을 부여합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:73
msgid "In Azure, final state of the permissions for the application."
msgstr "Azure에서 애플리케이션 권한의 최종 상태입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:76
msgid "You're all set for configuration in the Azure portal."
msgstr "이제 Azure 포털에서의 구성이 모두 완료되었습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:79
msgid "Install the Microsoft Calendar Integration"
msgstr "Microsoft Calendar 통합 설치"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:81
msgid ""
"Log in to your Mattermost :doc:`workspace </end-user-guide/end-user-"
"guide-index>` as a system admin."
msgstr "시스템 관리자로 OKR.BEST :doc:`워크스페이스 </end-user-guide/end-user-guide-index>`\\ 에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:82
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, from the Product menu |product-list|, select **App "
"Marketplace**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 제품 메뉴 |product-list|\\ 에서 **앱 마켓플레이스**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:100
msgid ""
"Navigate between Channels, collaborative playbooks, and boards using the "
"product menu icon."
msgstr "제품 메뉴 아이콘을 사용해 채널, 공동 플레이북, 보드 사이를 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:83
msgid "Search for or scroll to Microsoft Calendar, and select **Install**."
msgstr "Microsoft Calendar를 검색하거나 스크롤하여 찾은 뒤 **설치**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:84
msgid ""
"Once installed, select **Configure**. You're taken to the System Console,"
" directly to the **Microsoft Calendar** integration page, under "
"**Plugins**."
msgstr "설치되면 **구성**\\ 을 선택합니다. 관리자 도구의 **플러그인** 아래에 있는 **Microsoft Calendar** 통합 페이지로 바로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:88
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.11.2 (ESR) and Mattermost Cloud v10, this plugin is "
"pre-packaged with the Mattermost Server. If your Mattermost deployment is"
" on a release prior to v9.11.2, download the `latest plugin binary "
"release <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-"
"mscalendar/releases>`_, and upload it to your server via **System Console"
" > Plugin Management**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v9.11.2(ESR) 및 Mattermost Cloud v10부터 이 플러그인은 OKR.BEST 서버에 사전 패키징되어 있습니다. OKR.BEST 배포가 v9.11.2 이전 릴리스인 경우, `최신 플러그인 바이너리 릴리스 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-mscalendar/releases>`_\\ 를 다운로드하여 **관리자 도구 > 플러그인 관리**\\ 를 통해 서버에 업로드하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:91
msgid "Enable and configure the Microsoft Calendar Integration in Mattermost"
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Calendar 통합 활성화 및 구성"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:93
msgid ""
"In Azure, copy the **Application (client) ID** and **Directory (tenant) "
"ID** from the Azure portal."
msgstr "Azure에서 Azure 포털의 **Application (client) ID**\\ 와 **Directory (tenant) ID**\\ 를 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:95
msgid "In Azure, copy the Client ID and Tenant ID values."
msgstr "Azure에서 Client ID와 Tenant ID 값을 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:98
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, go to **System Console > Plugins > Microsoft Calendar** to"
" enable this integration."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 이 통합을 활성화하려면 **관리자 도구 > 플러그인 > Microsoft Calendar**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:100
msgid ""
"Copy the **Application (client) ID** and **Directory (tenant) ID** from "
"the Azure portal."
msgstr "Azure 포털에서 **Application (client) ID**\\ 와 **Directory (tenant) ID**\\ 를 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:102
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, enter the following values in the fields provided. Select "
"**Save** to apply the configuration:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 제공된 필드에 다음 값을 입력합니다. 구성을 적용하려면 **저장**\\ 을 선택합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:104
msgid ""
"**Admin User IDs** - A comma-separated list of :ref:`user IDs "
"<administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-"
"settings:identify a user's id>` for authorized users who can manage this "
"integration."
msgstr "**Admin User IDs** - 이 통합을 관리할 수 있는 권한이 있는 사용자의 :ref:`사용자 ID <administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings:identify a user's id>`\\ 를 쉼표로 구분한 목록입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Copy plugin logs to admins, as bot messages** - Select the log level "
"for logs."
msgstr "**Copy plugin logs to admins, as bot messages** - 로그의 로그 수준을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:106
msgid ""
"**Display full context for each admin log message** - Show or hide full "
"context for all log entries."
msgstr "**Display full context for each admin log message** - 모든 로그 항목의 전체 컨텍스트를 표시하거나 숨깁니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Azure - Directory (tenant) ID** - Paste the **Directory (tenant) ID** "
"from the Azure portal."
msgstr "**Azure - Directory (tenant) ID** - Azure 포털의 **Directory (tenant) ID**\\ 를 붙여넣습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Azure - Application (client) ID** - Paste the **Application (client) "
"ID** from the Azure portal."
msgstr "**Azure - Application (client) ID** - Azure 포털의 **Application (client) ID**\\ 를 붙여넣습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Office Client Secret** - Copy from the Azure portal "
"(generated in **Certificates & secrets** earlier in these instructions)."
msgstr "**Microsoft Office Client Secret** - Azure 포털에서 복사합니다(이 안내의 앞부분에서 **Certificates & secrets**\\ 에서 생성함)."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:111
msgid ""
"Notify your teams that they can `connect their Microsoft Office accounts "
"to Mattermost <#connect-a-microsoft-calendar-account-to-mattermost>`__."
msgstr "팀에 `Microsoft Office 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결 <#connect-a-microsoft-calendar-account-to-mattermost>`__\\ 할 수 있음을 알리세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:114
msgid "Use"
msgstr "사용"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:116
msgid ""
"Users who want to use Microsoft Calendar interconnectivity must connect a"
" Microsoft Office account to Mattermost."
msgstr "Microsoft Calendar 상호 연결을 사용하려는 사용자는 Microsoft Office 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:118
msgid "Example of the Connect Account prompt in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST의 계정 연결 프롬프트 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:121
msgid ""
"Once connected, you'll receive direct messages from the Microsoft "
"Calendar bot in Mattermost for Microsoft Calendar activity."
msgstr "연결되면 Microsoft Calendar 활동에 대해 OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Calendar 봇으로부터 개인 메시지를 받게 됩니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:123
msgid ""
"Example of the first direct message from the Microsoft Calendar bot in "
"Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Calendar 봇이 보낸 첫 개인 메시지의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:126
msgid ""
"See your upcoming events for the current day by typing ``/mscalendar "
"today`` in the message input box."
msgstr "메시지 입력 상자에 ``/mscalendar today``\\ 를 입력하여 당일의 예정된 일정을 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:128
msgid "Example of a direct message from the Microsoft Calendar bot in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Calendar 봇이 보낸 개인 메시지의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:131
msgid ""
"A list of all supported slash commands are available by typing "
"``/mscalendar help`` in the message input box."
msgstr "메시지 입력 상자에 ``/mscalendar help``\\ 를 입력하면 지원되는 모든 슬래시 명령어 목록을 확인할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:133
msgid "Example of supported slash commands for Microsoft Calendar in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Calendar가 지원하는 슬래시 명령어의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:136
msgid ""
"You can customize your notification preferences by typing ``/mscalendar "
"settings`` in the message input box."
msgstr "메시지 입력 상자에 ``/mscalendar settings``\\ 를 입력하여 알림 기본 설정을 사용자 정의할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:138
msgid "Example of the Microsoft Calendar settings in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST의 Microsoft Calendar 설정 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:142
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:144
msgid ""
"We recommend updating this integration as new versions are released. "
"Generally, updates are seamless and don't interrupt the user experience "
"in Mattermost. Visit the `Releases page <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-mscalendar/releases>`__ for the latest release, "
"available releases, and compatibiilty considerations."
msgstr "새 버전이 출시될 때 이 통합을 업데이트할 것을 권장합니다. 일반적으로 업데이트는 매끄럽게 이루어지며 OKR.BEST의 사용자 경험을 방해하지 않습니다. 최신 릴리스, 사용 가능한 릴리스, 호환성 고려 사항은 `릴리스 페이지 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-mscalendar/releases>`__\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:147
msgid "Get help"
msgstr "도움말 보기"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:149
msgid ""
"Customers with a Mattermost subscription can open a `Mattermost support "
"case <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_. Community "
"deployments can report a bug by opening a GitHub issue against the "
"`Mattermost Microsoft Calendar plugin repository "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-mscalendar>`_."
msgstr "Mattermost 구독이 있는 고객은 `Mattermost 지원 케이스 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 를 열 수 있습니다. 커뮤니티 배포에서는 `Mattermost Microsoft Calendar 플러그인 리포지토리 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-mscalendar>`_\\ 에 GitHub 이슈를 열어 버그를 신고할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:151
msgid ""
"For questions, feedback, and assistance, join our pubic `Integrations and"
" Apps channel "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_ on the "
"`Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_ for "
"assistance."
msgstr "질문, 피드백, 도움이 필요하면 `Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 의 공개 `Integrations and Apps channel <https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_\\ 에 참여하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-calendar.rst:153
msgid ""
"Mattermost Team Edition and Free customers can visit the Mattermost "
"`peer-to-peer troubleshooting forum <https://forum.mattermost.com/c"
"/trouble-shoot/16>`_ to access the global Mattermost Community for "
"assistance."
msgstr "Mattermost Team Edition 및 Free 고객은 Mattermost `P2P 문제 해결 포럼 <https://forum.mattermost.com/c/trouble-shoot/16>`_\\ 을 방문하여 글로벌 Mattermost 커뮤니티의 도움을 받을 수 있습니다."

